  "hypothesis": "On the physical image the two-role ring with more stages overlaps transfer and op1-MMA service but the third stage does not shorten the tail mm makespan (RTL 61,503/60,725/66,467 cycles for stages 1/2/3), because shared DMA admission and home service limit additional stages.",
  "competing_explanations": [
    "a requested ring is not executed (checked from the artifact ring plan)",
    "physical HBM latency hides or exposes overlap differently than the RTL stand-in",
    "accumulator moves counted as useful overlap",
    "placement changes between candidates"
  ],
  "expected_counter_changes": [
    "ring plans with 1/2/3 stages present in executed artifacts; inputs and placements identical",
    "device cycles: stage 2 <= stage 1 on exact tiles; stage 3 not better than stage 2 on the tail shape"
  ],
  "expected_observations": [
    "4 configurations x 3 independent rotated processes pass standard Torch mm/addmm on 16x16x48 and 17x31x65"
  ],
